# Check out every text file with LF line endings on every platform.
# Several tests compare committed fixtures and docs byte for byte with
# generated text (viz fixture-model.json, golden files, the SAFETY.md mask
# table), and a CRLF checkout on Windows made those fail in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.knxprod binary
*.knxproj binary
*.pcap binary
*.pcapng binary
*.db binary
